## IMPORTANT IMPLEMENTATION NOTES

- Do NOT modify App.razor — it should stay per-page (no `@rendermode` on Routes).
- Do NOT modify Routes.razor.
- The `StarRating` component must use `@rendermode InteractiveServer` directly on itself (not on the parent page).
- The `SubmitRecipe` page uses `@rendermode InteractiveServer` because the entire page needs interactivity for the form.
- All other pages (Home, Category, RecipeDetail) are static SSR — do NOT add `@rendermode` to them.
- Make sure to create directories (Models/, Services/) before creating files in them.
- Use `mkdir -p` to create directories.
